8,Tunica Language (TUN) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/tun/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..dwWPsJD0q0AqPp1s8ER1jeVIPX46MNvM2NqjK8dyXC8,Tunica is a dormant language of the United States. It is an isolate that is not known to be related to any other language.It belongs to the Language isolate language family. Existing Content. Literature.,Tunica,Language isolate
9,Tunica language Research Papers - Academia.edu,https://www.academia.edu/Documents/in/Tunica_language,"Tunica is a language isolate formerly spoken in the Lower Mississippi Valley. Today, members of the Tunica-Biloxi Tribe are reawakening this language through intensive language education and cultural practice.",Tunica,Language isolate
